@baseUrl = http://localhost:4201
@apiVersion = 1
@domain = core
@workflow = error-boundary-lab
@globalWorkflow = error-boundary-lab-global
@user = 11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111
@viewerRole = eb-lab.viewer

# ============================================================================
# error-boundary-lab — boundary çözümlemesi, incident yüzeyleri, retry
#
# Ön koşul: lokal runtime (4201) `feature/incident-table` üzerinde koşuyor,
# MockLab 3001'de ayakta ve error-boundary-lab seed'i yüklü.
# Bileşenleri yayınlamak için: build-error-boundary-lab.py + definitions/publish.
# ============================================================================

### 1. Instance başlat (hub state: ready)
# @name start
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/instances/start?sync=true
Content-Type: application/json
user_reference: {{user}}

{ "testId": "http-probe", "shouldFail": true }

@instanceId = {{start.response.body.$.id}}

### 2. Task seviyesi abort — instance fault eder (HTTP 200, gövdede status "F")
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/instances/{{instanceId}}/transitions/case-task-abort?sync=true
Content-Type: application/json
user_reference: {{user}}

{}

### 3. State function — her zaman var olan `incident` bloğu: yalnız bayrak + linkler
#    ({ hasActiveIncident, active: { href }, history: { href } }); `active` sadece açık arıza varken
#    görünür. Detay için 5a'yı çağırın. (+ ETag başlığı)
# @name state
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/instances/{{instanceId}}/functions/state
user_reference: {{user}}

@etag = {{state.response.headers.ETag}}

### 4. Aynı ETag ile koşullu okuma — 304 bekleriz
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/instances/{{instanceId}}/functions/state
user_reference: {{user}}
If-None-Match: {{etag}}

### 5a. Aktif incident — state bloğunun `incident.active.href` ile gösterdiği endpoint.
#     Açık arıza yokken 404 (Instance:100037) döner, bu normal bir yanıttır.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/instances/{{instanceId}}/incidents/active
user_reference: {{user}}

### 5. Incident geçmişi (sayfalı, en yeni önce) — bir abort TEK satır bırakır,
#    ve o satır boundary'nin verdict'idir (boundaryAction "Abort", boundaryLevel "Task")
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/instances/{{instanceId}}/incidents?page=1&pageSize=20
user_reference: {{user}}

### 6. Sayfalama — tek satırda hasNext false. İki satır için 8'i çalıştırıp
#    yeniden fault ettirin (her fault bir satır ekler).
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/instances/{{instanceId}}/incidents?page=1&pageSize=1
user_reference: {{user}}

### 7. Instance metadata.incident — state bloğuyla BİREBİR aynı şekil (bayrak + iki link)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/instances/{{instanceId}}
user_reference: {{user}}

### 8. Retry — hata hâlâ silahlı: yeniden fault eder (gövde status "F", ve bu statü
#    KALICI: instance F kalır, tekrar retry edilebilir)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/instances/{{instanceId}}/retry?sync=true
Content-Type: application/json
user_reference: {{user}}

{ "attributes": { "shouldFail": true } }

### 9. Retry — hatayı sustur: aynı task başarıya döner, instance `landed`,
#    ve TÜM açık incident'lar resolve olur (hasActiveIncident false)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/instances/{{instanceId}}/retry?sync=true
Content-Type: application/json
user_reference: {{user}}

{ "attributes": { "shouldFail": false } }

### 10. Retry — faulted olmayan instance reddedilir (400, Instance:100027)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/instances/{{instanceId}}/retry?sync=true
Content-Type: application/json
user_reference: {{user}}

{}

# ============================================================================
# Boundary matrisi — her biri taze instance ister (2. adımı yeni id ile tekrarlayın)
# ============================================================================

### 11. State seviyesi notify → notified (boundaryLevel "State")
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/instances/{{instanceId}}/transitions/case-state-notify?sync=true
Content-Type: application/json
user_reference: {{user}}

{}

### 12. Task seviyesi rollback → rolled-back, incident resolved
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/instances/{{instanceId}}/transitions/case-task-rollback?sync=true
Content-Type: application/json
user_reference: {{user}}

{}

### 13. Retry tükenmesi → 3 çağrı (httpAttempts), sonra abort fallback
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/instances/{{instanceId}}/transitions/case-retry-exhaust?sync=true
Content-Type: application/json
user_reference: {{user}}

{}

### 14. Retry kurtarma → 3. denemede 200, incident YOK
# Önce MockLab sequence'ini sıfırlayın (aşağıdaki 19-20).
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/instances/{{instanceId}}/transitions/case-retry-recover?sync=true
Content-Type: application/json
user_reference: {{user}}

{}

### 15. queryRoles kapısı — ROLSÜZ: 403 (Authorization:110001)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/instances/{{instanceId}}/transitions/case-secured?sync=true
Content-Type: application/json
user_reference: {{user}}

{}

### 16. Rolsüz incident okuma → 403
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/instances/{{instanceId}}/incidents
user_reference: {{user}}

### 17. Rollü incident okuma → 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/instances/{{instanceId}}/incidents
user_reference: {{user}}
x-roles: {{viewerRole}}
role: {{viewerRole}}

# ============================================================================
# Global boundary akışı
# ============================================================================

### 18. Global akışta instance başlat
# @name startGlobal
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/{{globalWorkflow}}/instances/start?sync=true
Content-Type: application/json
user_reference: {{user}}

{ "testId": "http-probe-global", "shouldFail": true }

@globalInstanceId = {{startGlobal.response.body.$.id}}

### 19. Global rollback (503) → rolled-back, boundaryLevel "Global"
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/{{globalWorkflow}}/instances/{{globalInstanceId}}/transitions/g-case-global-rollback?sync=true
Content-Type: application/json
user_reference: {{user}}

{}

### 20. Boundary var ama eşleşmiyor (500 vs 503) → F, boundaryAction/Level yok
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/{{globalWorkflow}}/instances/{{globalInstanceId}}/transitions/g-case-unhandled-no-match?sync=true
Content-Type: application/json
user_reference: {{user}}

{}

# ============================================================================
# MockLab yardımcıları (sequence durumu MockLab genelinde paylaşılır)
# ============================================================================

### 21. Mock listesi — flaky mock'un id'sini bulun
GET http://localhost:3001/_admin/mocks

### 22. flaky sequence'ini başa sar (id'yi 21'den alın)
POST http://localhost:3001/_admin/mocks/37/sequence/reset
